sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SV as Joseph (supervisor)
    participant L as Protection ledger
    actor RV as Ravi (worker)
    actor HS as Sara (HSE lead)
    SV->>L: Accept, start, report complete (his attestation, E2)
    L-->>RV: Restore water: reported complete
    RV->>L: "This didn't happen"
    L->>L: disputed, then escalated to HSE
    L-->>SV: "A worker disputed this" (no name shown)
    HS->>L: Accept, then resolve with a written finding
    L-->>HS: Refused: needs her own fresh check made after the dispute
    HS->>L: Independent spot check (E4) and finding
    L->>L: Dispute resolved, task verified at E4
    L-->>RV: "The HSE lead checked. Press again if it is still missing"
    Note over SV,HS: Every step is written to the hash-chained audit log
